# An allowlist, not a denylist. This repository has a rule about what must never
# leave it -- client transcripts, media, datasets, model weights -- and a
# denylist is one forgotten line away from baking a checkpoint into a public
# image. Everything is excluded here and only the study is put back.
*

!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!LICENSE
!src
!benchmarks
!assets
!docs

# Nothing below is wanted even inside the directories above.
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.DS_Store
